@adawqaf
 has celebrated the graduation of first cohort of 34 endowment trustees from its Trustees Enablement Programme. Held from 29 June-1 July 2026, the programme advanced endowment management capabilities through best-practice governance and institutional frameworks.

The Fallen Heroes’ Affairs Office, in partnership with 
@AqdarUAE
, has unveiled a new set of initiatives to empower martyrs’ children and families by developing their academic, professional and leadership skills. The initiatives begin with the Academic Pathway Initiative.
